{"unit_id":"zxzc114514__dsh-crash-guard#card-zh","repo":"zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard","commit":"526bb91ff0c72357840376d723bbe192c53e417f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Crash Guard 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的启动恢复插件。它接入宿主的 clientModules 注册表，对前端插件产物做语法和模块注册格式预检，并从启动图谱中移除未通过检查的插件。主要功能包括隔离故障版本、在代码更新后恢复重试、汇总宿主和浏览器端的故障信息，以及通过 shell.overlay 救援面板查看详情和操作隔离。适合希望在插件异常时仍能进入 DSH 界面并排查故障的用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本及 DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 至 0.3.0 之前版本；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-104","index.js:118-188","index.js:1271-1310","client.js:903-914"]}
{"unit_id":"zxzc114514__dsh-crash-guard#card-en","repo":"zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard","commit":"526bb91ff0c72357840376d723bbe192c53e417f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Crash Guard checks frontend plugin bundles for syntax and module format errors, removes failed plugins from the startup graph, and remembers quarantined revisions. A shell.overlay rescue panel shows failures and provides quarantine controls. Requires Node.js 20+ and DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 to <0.3.0.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-104","index.js:118-188","index.js:1271-1310","client.js:903-914"]}
