{"unit_id":"zxzc114514__dsh-crash-guard#feature-1","repo":"zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard","commit":"526bb91ff0c72357840376d723bbe192c53e417f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Crash Guard 的功能「启动前端插件预检」：宿主启动时检查已注册前端 bundle 的脚本语法和模块注册标记；检查失败的第三方插件会从模块表移除，并重建启动图谱。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-104","index.js:118-188"]}
{"unit_id":"zxzc114514__dsh-crash-guard#feature-2","repo":"zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard","commit":"526bb91ff0c72357840376d723bbe192c53e417f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Crash Guard 的功能「按版本保存故障隔离」：插件将隔离条目和文件版本指纹写入当前 Profile 的状态文件；重启时同步状态，版本指纹变化后移除旧隔离并允许重新加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:403-443","index.js:457-543"]}
